# Documentation and method artefacts.
#
# These are prose owned by other agents and by the user, not application
# code: `ai-rules/` and `ai-agents/` are the method (owned by @ai-method),
# `specs/functional/` is the functional source (owned by the user),
# `context/` is project state (maintained by @committer), and `docker/` and
# `.devcontainer/` ship as skeletons under @ai-method.
#
# Prettier reflows markdown - list markers, wrapping, table padding - which
# would rewrite documents this agent does not own and produce conflicts
# between agents editing the tree at the same time. The formatting gate
# exists for code, so it is scoped to code.
